WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:14.175
Squirrel: I see something.

2
00:00:14.176 --> 00:00:27.368
Turtle: What do you see?

3
00:00:27.369 --> 00:00:32.050
Squirrel: I see the stream.

4
00:00:32.051 --> 00:00:40.431
Turtle: I see the stream too.

5
00:00:40.432 --> 00:00:50.841
Squirrel: I see rocks in the stream.

6
00:00:50.842 --> 00:01:00.421
Turtle: I see fish in the stream.

7
00:01:00.422 --> 00:01:08.265
Squirrel: I see us in the stream.

8
00:01:08.266 --> 00:01:27.418
Turtle: I see trees in the stream.

9
00:01:27.419 --> 00:01:32.677
Squirrel: Wow! I see something in the trees.

10
00:01:32.678 --> 00:01:36.603
Turtle: What do you see?

11
00:01:36.604 --> 00:01:59.472
Squirrel: I see . . . nuts!

12
00:01:59.482 --> 00:02:07.369
Squirrel: I got a lot of nuts!

13
00:02:07.370 --> 00:02:12.270
Turtle: Yes, you did.

14
00:02:12.271 --> 00:02:36.177
Squirrel: Oof! I did not see that stick!

